  "description": "Speed is nothing if you can’t hold the position. That idea sits at the center of the Speedmachine 01 TWO, where we focused on matching rider position adjustability with a confidence-inspiring ride feel that allows you to stay in the aerobars over the long run. Born from a design collaboration between the BMC Impec Lab and Red Bull Advanced Technologies, this is the fastest triathlon bike the industry has ever produced.\nThe uncompromising 01 Premium Carbon layup provides the stiffness you need to push hard, allying with a mixed Di2 Ultegra and Dura Ace groupset with 4iiii power meter for snappy shifting and on-ride data. Wheels are our CR50 Carbon for a balance of aero gains and crosswind stability. Up front, Profile Design’s Aeria 3 armrests and extensions lock in your position so you can stay fast for longer.\nNow it’s time to find out what a difference expert frame engineering can make.",
